### 新增流程 - 采购申请流程（多级审批）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "员工采购申请流程",
  "roleCode": "STAFF",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "nodeName": "主管审批",
      "nodeOrder": 1,
      "assigneeType": "RELATIVE",
      "assigneeExpr": "manager_id",
      "conditionExpr": "amount <= 1000"
    },
    {
      "nodeName": "经理审批",
      "nodeOrder": 2,
      "assigneeType": "RELATIVE",
      "assigneeExpr": "manager_id.manager_id",
      "conditionExpr": "amount > 1000"
    }
  ]
}

### 新增流程 - 流程名称已存在
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/definitions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{admin_token}}

{
  "name": "员工报销流程",
  "roleCode": "STAFF",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "nodeName": "主管审批",
      "nodeOrder": 1,
      "assigneeType": "RELATIVE",
      "assigneeExpr": "manager_id",
      "conditionExpr": "amount <= 1000"
    }
  ]
}

